{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_001tom_01_1_2_001_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:eaf3af6078add97a399b50279466b5c664fe4bf70eeb53783a4afbf34e9bbbba",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_01_1_2_001_01:1_2_001_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ec5c55e7961103b208375682e51af42d89ae4c2599f6bbff0756d993f5af866",
      "text": "值得依靠的成年人",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_01_1_2_001_01:1_2_001_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf1f22a1e2853cd157f4fe46d9a624fb4a98144bf3a9be387477ff31e85b4fbb",
      "text": "节目录制结束后，冬马为了收拾行李回到了\n休息室。然而，冬马却在那里发现自己\n丢了东西。在制作人的协助下一同寻找时，\n冬马注意到了某种可能性。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_01_1_2_001_01:1_2_001_01_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_01_1_2_001_01:1_2_001_01_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ec5c55e7961103b208375682e51af42d89ae4c2599f6bbff0756d993f5af866",
      "text": "值得依靠的成年人",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_01_1_2_001_01:1_2_001_01_a:cmd-000012:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa09216fbe1720584c8a3cdb13cfdf6b2493ed19f9d789f2446f25e399d3ecb0",
      "text": "冬马家中·厨房",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_01_1_2_001_01:1_2_001_01_a:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e0bda1ecbddecdff83f521f5b723ac67edb71b2734f43f1c287f15670e995f86",
      "text": "配菜准备成这样差不多了吧。\n接下来只要把肉处理好就行了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_01_1_2_001_01:1_2_001_01_a:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7474f99bbf996c15dd466b1d84240d003e0b1196c0b5882fa62a3d0193368093",
      "text": "昨天的特卖真是太走运了！\n没想到能这么便宜买到这么好的肉。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_01_1_2_001_01:1_2_001_01_a:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9aa4c84d3f731cae39cde907b255f3c0f88b8dbfe06e2569381a2bf41aad728f",
      "text": "把这肉泡进特制酱汁里腌好……\n这样就行了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_01_1_2_001_01:1_2_001_01_a:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:80c23b494c5e3d0d023cb09e9b2f6bb83139ee039b62c7ff8bdcccb23e2ecdc0",
      "text": "到晚上应该就腌入味了。\n真期待做出来的成品啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_01_1_2_001_01:1_2_001_01_a:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b767363101dcd5e4cfec5f4748b8eda6a73cd7b9c575c9b9c6ad6bb9f9be51d",
      "text": "（饭也准备好了，时间刚刚好）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_01_1_2_001_01:1_2_001_01_a:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97ad49cca797f2fcc0a1a80c74e3833dc96365bbbf2a4a6b9860fc382df5db05",
      "text": "好，差不多该出发了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_01_1_2_001_01:1_2_001_01_a:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:149fad5d35f822c7bb12dcb8cc8cd75414852b834da2027fabe946b04f8e5c86",
      "text": "今天是要录制综艺节目来着吧……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_01_1_2_001_01:1_2_001_01_a:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dbeaf170cb79a75b3b18ea0ee763c4ee3877f016c12c52602ceeff6747bc9b32",
      "text": "去电视台和●●●●プロデューサー汇合，\n然后排练……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_01_1_2_001_01:1_2_001_01_a:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:790d361b57298583e7e3730952f15abe9029239b1ba0e780430fa54f4c1d8a0a",
      "text": "……好嘞！\n今天也干劲十足地冲吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_01_1_2_001_01:1_2_001_01_a:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd92c5de6aacf86be1844d7c8a32483d00d28fa5fe98b6bb6abedfac3a144099",
      "text": "那，我出门了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_01_1_2_001_01:1_2_001_01_b:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f10f377623d30a2f8e6eef9924c2cd8b7962dcbd80ad5f1e46aca35a570d7f4",
      "text": "录制结束后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_01_1_2_001_01:1_2_001_01_b:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6af3762ebfd0f0e94e12609f933a8f5941a23c9a696e2c0ce3b2316fd2c7bae",
      "text": "冬马先生，录制辛苦了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_01_1_2_001_01:1_2_001_01_b:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8705ff7d3e38f3df59f5307d9d99652a3ce3ea76932f9bf1e7d02d3a990f0ad9",
      "text": "哦，辛苦啦！\n今天的录制也进展顺利，真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_01_1_2_001_01:1_2_001_01_b:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a2e3ab28e1604601f11a48a22498ba530cf317f278b829edb1a3bc485b09df7",
      "text": "效果挺不错的，真期待播出啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_01_1_2_001_01:1_2_001_01_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bbcf0ba3c9e1af7b5d79eab2635d1ef139a2a8cdc7d1b690c6b5f2c80739dec5",
      "text": "我也是！\n好期待播出的那天啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_01_1_2_001_01:1_2_001_01_b:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:40b12016a6ce3afeb3057e4405ca8fb3dc94fcb9282d0c40e79794848ee2cd4d",
      "text": "今天的工作就到此为止了，\n您直接回家没问题吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_01_1_2_001_01:1_2_001_01_b:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a043b8b72b21d45e43c7a0381fea357b58d5f70924b28f326b844e5000d5583",
      "text": "嗯！我去休息室收拾一下准备回去。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_01_1_2_001_01:1_2_001_01_b:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:edbbff607577e1a691a046fb32b97e722c5db2b2bb609f49a0751c21c1b99e2f",
      "text": "……各位工作人员，我先告辞了！\n辛苦大家了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_01_1_2_001_01:1_2_001_01_b:cmd-000064:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0edfc213b2c45a845881a59b62f0d67bcfd80065792d9df654ba0c95eb6ba4a2",
      "text": "休息室",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_01_1_2_001_01:1_2_001_01_b:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:86479786e354f047493517c77d754b8350e57327bfda72515ebc99ed2ad286e4",
      "text": "唔，我还有别的行李吗……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_01_1_2_001_01:1_2_001_01_b:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4eb694dfacb1e443e3ebe21c6643d7f531d23b82ea1ec61b829ab91b9cefab41",
      "text": "肚子有点饿了。……我记得包里的\n这附近，放着北斗给的点心……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_01_1_2_001_01:1_2_001_01_b:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ee070060d52e7f88bda8190ca00f38ace643ff89fd3ad047a7fe4db3cd7ff6f",
      "text": "嗯？……咦，奇怪？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_01_1_2_001_01:1_2_001_01_b:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3fd15bc60c1dbf6d15f4a0bac892981e99f2c1f4c8ade226d17206f3940bd740",
      "text": "（冬马先生还没回来呢。怎么了吗）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_01_1_2_001_01:1_2_001_01_c:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94d3c41710421847e232d70d8276cb6196c9b366c3e24996189330ce39605ed8",
      "text": "家里的钥匙不见了……？\n不对，是不是放在别的地方了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_01_1_2_001_01:1_2_001_01_c:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39b6a35c4dddcd5e0b91f5c99449961fb8a994a3b3348b195aac7ffce307654e",
      "text": "……没有啊。\n糟了，这下该怎么办。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_01_1_2_001_01:1_2_001_01_c:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0144aedaa62221679b8ea1859766e054544729b4eccf7d87cab19dc28884b492",
      "text": "冬马先生，发生什么事了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_01_1_2_001_01:1_2_001_01_c:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7895248ab20e871b43f90f7b885b2d0cd89aa0872f342109dc3a6e011ffa7630",
      "text": "那个，我好像把家里的钥匙弄丢了。\n刚才在找呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_01_1_2_001_01:1_2_001_01_c:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eed4ccd7166bbad47fb55ac6678dcce790615f129e42bbc57fde84156fed2f7c",
      "text": "哎！？\n我也一起帮您找！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_01_1_2_001_01:1_2_001_01_c:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:159dce7745c58f7c4c055114bf43a2accf26fa9eb31d7b5b5c20b09917224943",
      "text": "不好意思啊。我也去问问电视台的工作人员\n有没有捡到失物！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_01_1_2_001_01:1_2_001_01_c:cmd-000061:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94c47e71a7f809652716c93dcac4901345742e2813115851d14db6b4d4bcc329",
      "text": "几分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_01_1_2_001_01:1_2_001_01_c:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43a1af880525f98a2795b89a0007620b9aeced727d8939c5795bf5a1f5c53223",
      "text": "没人捡到送过去啊……\n难道说，我出门时忘锁家门了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_01_1_2_001_01:1_2_001_01_c:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4577f41ff1f2907d2be7dd73ba5f4e47f6883a64f3d22b8863f475afa990709b",
      "text": "那样的话，得赶快回家看看！\n我马上叫计程车。我也跟您一起去。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_01_1_2_001_01:1_2_001_01_c:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e3f8a70ee621bcaef752252fc62a1cbe7b88e2ba152a8eddda4287db8b239822",
      "text": "哎！？不用啦制作人。\n我一个人去也没……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_01_1_2_001_01:1_2_001_01_c:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a0b54581dad0e14e60b77112197c30ebb54276a1e8fe6059ed16f1f06a5f7fb7",
      "text": "万一冬马先生遇到什么危险就糟了。\n拜托了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_01_1_2_001_01:1_2_001_01_c:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:90081dbd46335329c1c1f1603c2d0fcfb543d7c6633269a4bcf71be4b437007c",
      "text": "……我知道了。那就拜托你了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_01_1_2_001_01:1_2_001_01_d:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:040699270c7d4ea93fef273649b9fcd5a4b38ee3343622bf542ff181965c2228",
      "text": "计程车·车内",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_01_1_2_001_01:1_2_001_01_d:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d7c9dccc2a39eafb590d4ee9943612197edab173ecbe1e4a9c5313b4cc3bcf3",
      "text": "好的，麻烦开到这附近就行了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_01_1_2_001_01:1_2_001_01_d:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dac662c3631f91963d09e58710fdf375d0531abb24471c4c0e6ecd227d39785b",
      "text": "不好意思啊，制作人。\n给你添麻烦了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_01_1_2_001_01:1_2_001_01_d:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7661a3e2d62224388f3291d82ec6812e0ea908db5b1a19ba8530f5068be40303",
      "text": "请别介意。\n冬马先生的人身安全是第一位的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_01_1_2_001_01:1_2_001_01_d:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aaead44cc4409fac77bd00db14d9861190f1149babfec1b807c48eff9d31c1ff",
      "text": "……其实啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_01_1_2_001_01:1_2_001_01_d:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b1499aaaefccb93d10cd1e9cf4d45d1af44a615ad0dafa3181bad399538a0e0",
      "text": "我爸调去外地单身赴任了，\n现在家里只有我一个人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_01_1_2_001_01:1_2_001_01_d:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:007562dad4698ef371032613511650836c254f46340ec12daef317bbfa5251bd",
      "text": "要是忘锁门的话，就等于从早上开始\n一直大敞着门……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_01_1_2_001_01:1_2_001_01_d:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d3c73d7d7407e058feaad919d2dfe28cc08087ec44f1550deb8f3961d6e17eb4",
      "text": "这么一想，确实\n不知道会发生什么事呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_01_1_2_001_01:1_2_001_01_d:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:745c71c93d4a4f81d2e705176aa330cc679bf7d55c39f8812954dbddf1db9ff0",
      "text": "所以，你能陪我一起真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_01_1_2_001_01:1_2_001_01_d:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:28c655c9369ddc376e5a7bece98d5298126a29ad37b99251236f6075bf6d2f71",
      "text": "感觉超级安心的。谢啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_01_1_2_001_01:1_2_001_01_e:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa09216fbe1720584c8a3cdb13cfdf6b2493ed19f9d789f2446f25e399d3ecb0",
      "text": "冬马家中·厨房",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_01_1_2_001_01:1_2_001_01_e:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db7042b911b644003b56242f90ee20af318d02a59e902166ecf13f5c941c7cb8",
      "text": "钥匙在桌子上找到了，\n果然只是忘了锁门啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_01_1_2_001_01:1_2_001_01_e:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f97db877f535d0f54337672a33734e1f321d47db9b551930a6483ccb9f161e5",
      "text": "家里看起来也没什么事。呼……虚惊一场。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_01_1_2_001_01:1_2_001_01_e:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ace14ffbb4525cd17779dd8dea89f22fca91c55c11ade3f8d7d275c8e3f4004a",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，\n谢谢你陪我跑这一趟。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_01_1_2_001_01:1_2_001_01_e:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ec913d680a24b6391d709963a50a4c46552254bd75a16a8cc67865420efdbb4",
      "text": "……对了。喂，等会儿有空吗？\n不嫌弃的话，留下来吃个饭吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_01_1_2_001_01:1_2_001_01_e:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:396497800e68550fa190fd8ae093a1886163719f82851be6ea88aac95fe50d55",
      "text": "哎呀，这怎么好意思。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_01_1_2_001_01:1_2_001_01_e:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f158808d139fdb9c3276f41546761367c92e4c4eb539bf7625e9c559f815f20d",
      "text": "就当是今天的谢礼嘛。\n不过，要是有工作的话我也不会勉强就是了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_01_1_2_001_01:1_2_001_01_e:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1af4c3a0e6d532efe76af036e1ab880f11667239a6918038b521f0cff3292522",
      "text": "早上腌的肉应该差不多入味了，\n你要是能尝尝给我点感想，我也挺高兴的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_01_1_2_001_01:1_2_001_01_e:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a764c6b6a57a1a0eb799ec63d3cb4ba81090504bade63d833925ed43ea40b14",
      "text": "既然如此……我今天的工作也结束了，\n那就恭敬不如从命了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_01_1_2_001_01:1_2_001_01_e:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c167d5e25ccda0ee6dc23d9c06a18cec5da939fa636a350b061b115cf72d9a8",
      "text": "哦，这才对嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_001tom_01_1_2_001_01:1_2_001_01_e:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d90cac902baffae08d735dce1e3712e043caf892d580191b3c1e6af600a0ffaf",
      "text": "我会拿出看家本领好好做出来的。\n你就好好期待吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
